OL,3,GNEWSARestaurants sceptical over 'garlic
OL,4,Aand gherkins' plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FGarlic, gherkins and plant-based milk
OL,7,Fare among more than 100 products which
OL,8,Fshould become cheaper due to measures
OL,9,Fannounced in the Budget.
OL,11,FThe Treasury said the removal of import
OL,12,Ftariffs on dozens of items would save
OL,13,Fthe typical household about #21 a year
OL,14,Fon their food bill.
OL,16,FBut some businesses have questioned how
OL,17,Fmuch difference it will make to them,
OL,18,Fsuggesting that VAT cuts or moves to
OL,19,Fmake it cheaper for them to employ
OL,20,Fstaff would have been better.
