OL,3,GNEWSARestaurants sceptical over 'garlic
OL,4,Aand gherkins' plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FMorgan Austin, from burger chain
OL,7,FBurgerism, which has six main locations
OL,8,Fand first opened in Salford in 2018,
OL,9,Fsaid the removal of tariffs on gherkins
OL,10,Fwas good news.
